"events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "60dc4f7a6cb660e041239197287f1f6bd205d961", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deepshnv/pipeshard-mlsys26-ae/commits/60dc4f7a6cb660e041239197287f1f6bd205d961", "html_url": "https://github.com/deepshnv/pipeshard-mlsys26-ae/commit/60dc4f7a6cb660e041239197287f1f6bd205d961"}], "stats": {"total": 2, "additions": 1, "deletions": 1}, "files": [{"sha": "cdb8a95eee75304876412befe3af599baae95fa6", "filename": "README.md", "status": "modified", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1, "changes": 2, "blob_url": "https://github.com/deepshnv/pipeshard-mlsys26-ae/blob/7794a3f0240d31addc84edf78217c7dae1006e88/README.md", "raw_url": "https://github.com/deepshnv/pipeshard-mlsys26-ae/raw/7794a3f0240d31addc84edf78217c7dae1006e88/README.md", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deepshnv/pipeshard-mlsys26-ae/contents/README.md?ref=7794a3f0240d31addc84edf78217c7dae1006e88", "patch": "@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@\n # Introduction\n \n-This is the README for the artifact evaluation process for our **MLSys26 Paper:** [EFFICIENT, VRAM-CONSTRAINED XLM INFERENCE ON CLIENTS](link arriving soon).\n+This is the README for the artifact evaluation process for our **MLSys26 Paper:** [EFFICIENT, VRAM-CONSTRAINED XLM INFERENCE ON CLIENTS](https://mlsys.org/virtual/2026/oral/3802).\n \n We introduce a technique called pipelined sharding to enable running large LLMs (as well as language decoders of VLMs) at user-specified VRAM budgets through a combination of benchmark profile driven CPU-GPU hybrid scheduling and carefully orchestrated pipelined PCIe copies to avoid exposing copy costs. \n VLMOpt provides complementary VRAM-reduction optimizations for the vision encoder to enable VLMs to handle high-resolution image inference at user-specified VRAM budgets. "}]}